@page "/components/button-group"

<PageTitle>Button Group — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Button Group</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Buttons joined into one control, with the rounding and the shared edges handled for you. The
    buttons themselves stay ordinary buttons — which is what lets a select, an input or a popover
    trigger sit in the same group.
</p>
<p class="doc-note">
    Not the same thing as <a href="/components/toggle-group">Toggle Group</a>: a button group is
    several actions that happen to sit together, and a toggle group is one value chosen from
    several. If the thing has a state that persists, it is the other one.
</p>

