<h2 class="doc-h2">Separator</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    A rule between two buttons that are joined but not the same kind of thing. It takes the
    group's own colour, which is why upstream gives that slot <code>bg-input</code> rather than
    <code>bg-border</code>.
</p>
<Example Source="ButtonGroupSeparatorExample.razor"><ButtonGroupSeparatorExample /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Split</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    A default action and a menu of the others, as two separate buttons — so the common case is one
    click and the menu never gets in its way.
</p>
<Example Source="ButtonGroupSplit.razor"><ButtonGroupSplit /></Example>

